      "bbox": [
        213,
        798,
        1510,
        911
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City desires to more effectively manage and streamline the contracting and procurement process for necessary goods, services and construction, and to improve efficiency and cost-effectiveness in procurement; and",
